SAIVAS and the Humility principles (H1-H6) are intellectual property of
Dan Medina. This repository is released under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Layer 3 of the gate (`evaluate_layer_3` in safi_gate.py) is a port of the
Humility rule semantics from the reference implementation:

    https://github.com/Uniformedi/humility-guardrail

The rule split is preserved from that implementation -- H1/H3/H5 deny,
H2/H4/H6 abstain -- but the subject matter is not. humility-guardrail scores
conversational messages; SAFi Layer 3 scores proposed tool calls. The
adaptation and any errors in it belong to this repository, not to the
reference implementation.

